@startuml
title High-Level Design - AI-Based Satellite Urban Expansion\nand Land-Use Change Detection

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #444444

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
    BorderColor #555555
    RoundCorner 15
}

rectangle "Sentinel-2 Satellite Data\n\nOSCD Dataset\nBi-temporal Images\nT1 + T2" as INPUT

rectangle "Data Preprocessing\n\n• 13-band input\n• Normalization\n• Image alignment\n• Patch extraction\n• Train / Validation split" as PREPROCESS

rectangle "Five Hybrid Models\n\n1. Siamese CNN + ViT\n2. U-Net + Transformer\n3. ResNet + LSTM\n4. CNN + Change Detection Network\n5. Swin Transformer + U-Net" as MODELS

rectangle "Model Training\n\nBCE + Dice Loss\nAdamW Optimizer\nTraining-only Augmentation" as TRAIN

rectangle "Comparative Evaluation\n\nAccuracy\nPrecision\nRecall\nF1 Score\nIoU\nDice" as EVAL

rectangle "Best Model Selection\n\nEnhanced Siamese CNN + ViT" as BEST

rectangle "Urban Change Detection\n\nBi-temporal Feature Comparison\n+ Global Context Analysis" as DETECT

rectangle "Final Change Map\n\nPixel-wise Binary Map\n\nChanged / Unchanged" as OUTPUT

rectangle "Urban Expansion Analysis\n\nIdentification of\nChanged Built-up Regions" as ANALYSIS

INPUT --> PREPROCESS
PREPROCESS --> MODELS
MODELS --> TRAIN
TRAIN --> EVAL
EVAL --> BEST
BEST --> DETECT
DETECT --> OUTPUT
OUTPUT --> ANALYSIS

note right of BEST
Final enhanced model:
Siamese CNN + Vision Transformer

Training enhancement:
Spatial + spectral/temporal
perturbations
end note

note bottom
Goal:
Detect and visualize urban expansion
and land-use changes between
two satellite observations.
end note

@enduml